        '18855',
        'Corporate and as individual scenario issue',
        '•Alerts generate on same customer as corporate and as individual.',
        'Dear Abdulrahman,    Please be informed that the issue was that the screening process was not functioning properly due to a problem with the screening lists. These lists were either incomplete or not correctly updated, which led to inaccurate results and a large number of false alerts being generated.    To address this, we deleted all the alerts that were triggered based on the faulty data. We then manually updated the screening list to ensure its accuracy and consistency. After completing the update, we re-ran the screening process on the corrected data to ensure that it functions as expected moving forward.    This approach allowed us to clean up the inaccurate alerts and restore the screening process to its normal and reliable behavior.    Kindly check and confirm from your side,',
