(
        '18931',
        'Interest Rate Issue',
        'Dear PioTech team,    While checking the interest rates for accounts on PIO_ACT_RATE & PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST, we found out that some accounts are having wrong interest rate in both tables. Below are some examples for this issue :    •PIO_ACT_RATE : There are two cases :   oAccount has tier code and this tier code definition in table D9PF contains differential. The differential is not considered in the ETL. For example : Account 0002-265078-201, in PIO_ACT_RATE the interest rate is 25 while the correct one is 22.25  oAccount has tier code and the balance is exactly as the tier definition. For example : Account 0002-483532-202, the balance in 14/05/2025 is 500 EGP which should be considered as the first base code but the ETL consider it to be the second base code. Just need to add less than or equal to not less than only in the ETL code.  X  •PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST : There are three cases :   oAccount has tier code and this tier code definition in table D9PF contains differential. The differential is considered in the ETL but it is added instead of being subtracted in credit. For example : Account 0002-265078-201, in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST the interest rate is 25 while the correct one is 27.25  oSome accounts with tier, their interest rate is not matching the core banking.   ?For example : Account 0002-190833-002, in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST the interest rate is 15.5 while correct one is 16.5.   I believe this is an issue with calculating the correct tier level (bracket) since account balance is over 1M and less than 3M but the rate calculated is for the range between 750K and 1M.    ?Another Example : Account 0002-103814-001, in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST the interest rate is 14.61 while correct one is 12.42.   I believe this is an issue with calculating the correct tier level (bracket) since account balance is over 300K but the rate calculated is for the range less than 100K    oAccounts with Margin Rate, the margin should be subtracted in credit and added in debit. For example: Account 0069-626698-012, the interest rate in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST is 3.3287 while the correct one is 5.3287    Please support to fix those issues urgently and Please make sure that differential and margin is added in case of debit and is subtracted in case of credit.',
        'Dear Hassan,    Since this ticket is overdue and there is no response from your side, kindly note that we will close this ticket and issue a new one once you are ready.    Best Regards,',
