        'Misrouting of open alerts — alerts are appearing in the work queues of compliance officers not assigned to the originating branch (e.g., Kimironko alerts appearing to officers of other branches)',
        'Based on our web session, please note that we have reviewed the alerts for the "Kimironko branch" from 01 May 2025 until today. A total of 34 alerts were found for this branch. After reviewing them, we did not identify any issues with the alerts or with the branch itself. However, there are 2 alerts that remain open at Level 1 (Officer Users), as shown in the picture below:',
