        'Thank you @Ruba Al-Khatib for your kind support.    Dear @bilal.jabr@IIABANK.COM.JO,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:      • Issue Reported by the customer: ETL jobs.    • Status: Solved.    • Problem description: The FILL_ALL_TYPES ETL daily fill job keeps failing because the system was running low on virtual memory due to the long-time execution of the DF_IIAB_CUSTOMERS dataflow, which was taking nearly four hours to complete.         • Action Taken – recommended solution: Based on our web session, kindly be informed that the issue was resolved by performing tuning on dataflow DF_IIAB_CUSTOMERS, which now takes 16 minutes & re-executing the IIAB_FILL_ALL_JOBS job from the point where it had previously stopped at the dataflow DF_IIAB_CUSTOMERS for the date 06/07/2025. Noting that the FILL_ALL_TYPES ETL job has completed successfully. Currently, the remaining IIAB customized jobs within IIAB_FILL_ALL_JOBS are still running.    Kindly check from your side and confirm to close this ticket.     Best Regards,',
