        'Report issue',
        'Dear Braa,    The report should categorize the total account balances, based on the customer account balances for each currency, but the report print out the same value for both IQD and USA, and it’s not correct.   The screenshot of the error outlined below.',
        'Dear Mohammad,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:      • Issue Reported by the customer: Report issue.    • Status: Solved.    • Problem description: The customer reported that a customized report was returning the same value for both IQD and USD currencies, whereas it should return values based on the customer account’s currency.     • Action Taken – recommended solution: Based on our web session, kindly be informed that the issue was resolved by adding a currency base flag to both the local and foreign reports to categorize results based on the account currency. The report was then re-run for “30-June-2025,” and the data was retrieved correctly.  Kindly check from your side and confirm to close this ticket.     Best Regards,',
