        'Dear @Oula Michel,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:         Issue Reported by the customer: AML Statistic Report.        Status: Solved.       Problem description: The statistics report showed that new alerts were being opened with scenario codes 222222 and 222222-KYC.       Action Taken – recommended solution: Based on our web session, we investigated the issue and identified that alerts related to scenario codes (222222 and 222222-KYC) were being generated, even though these scenarios were marked as inactive. This behavior occurred because the Insert Manual option was still enabled for these scenarios in the Similarity Tool, as shown in the picture below:        However, we have now disabled the Insert Manual option in the Similarity Tool configuration and removed all work cases associated with scenario codes 222222 and 222222-KYC.    As a result, no further alerts will be generated under these scenario codes, Kindly check and confirm so we can close this ticket.',
