        'Based on our web session, the issue was resolved by setting all users as production users in the test environment. Additionally, the Officer user was created under the name (lvl) with the appropriate officer permissions. Mr. Abdulrahman''s user was also configured to match the production environment, using the same username and password.    All screening alerts are now appearing correctly from July 13 to July 15, as I have populated the data for the past four days. The entire screening cycle is now functioning as expected.',
