        '19306',
        'Facing an issue with the AML process as we didn’t receive any AML requests',
        'Dears,     We’re facing an issue with the AML process as we didn’t receive any AML requests since yesterday morning, please check ASAP as this is so urgent.  Best Regards,    ??Please consider the environment before printing this email   Mohammad Attallah  Core & Data Systems Team Member  Zain Cash Engineering  M:   T: 00962 79 7043 908  E: Mohammed.Attallah@jo.zain.com  www.jo.zain.com',
        'Dear @Mohammed Attallah,    Please find below my response for your consideration    Kindly review the attached error to determine its root cause and confirm whether it led to the service interruption. We would also appreciate your recommendations on how to prevent such issues from occurring in the future.  Pio-tech: We’ve reviewed the issue and found that the similarity service hanging due to heavy processing during similarity calculations, possibly compounded by recent Windows server updates or related windows server issues.  Additionally, we need to implement an alert mechanism that notifies us immediately if the service stops for any reason. This will help us take timely action and avoid any rejected registrations.  Pio-tech: Your request has been sent to the development team and will be included in the next release.  We also recall that a cron job was previously set up to automatically restart the service at 6:00 AM. Could you please confirm whether this is still active and functioning as intended?  Pio-tech: confirmed.',
